sparky-stereo-obs (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First version (ORDER 61, milestone 1): a module for OBS Studio 33 built
    against deb-multimedia's libobs-dev. Enable 3D sets the canvas to full side
    by side with the render resolution per eye and gives the canvas back when
    switched off; x264 writes the frame packing arrangement message (type 3,
    left eye first) while it encodes; before each start OBS says which encoder
    or file mark cannot be written and why, and the first keyframe of every
    running output is read to confirm it. The Stereo input filter converts
    every one-picture packing of the stereo layer's input list to full side
    by side, with the swap of the eyes; its words come from the layer's own
    catalogue, the module's sentences are in the ten languages.

 -- Daniel Ramos (Capitain Jack) <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>  Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:00:00 -0300
